@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/coverage/> .

# The counterexample supplies an entropy's logarithm base and information unit but
# omits its required probability distribution (math:overDistribution), isolating
# math:IncompleteInformationMeasure via the derived QualifiedMinCount constraint.
ex:entropy a math:Entropy ;
    math:informationBase math:logBaseTwo ;
    math:informationUnit math:bit .
